{"id":"importancia","lemma":"importancia","pos":"noun","rank":1485,"glosses":["importance"],"ipa":"/impoɾˈtanθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"importancias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-importancia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es de vital importancia.","en":"It's vitally important.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461583"},{"text":"Es de suma importancia.","en":"It is of the utmost importance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767980"},{"text":"Es un error sin importancia.","en":"That's a trivial error.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639445"},{"text":"El precio no tiene importancia.","en":"The price isn't important.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78788"},{"text":"Necesitáis saber la importancia de eso.","en":"You need to know how important this is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735250"}]}